    - Limestone blocks x8
    - Slate blocks x8
    - Marble blocks x8

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task. You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
