					<description>A group of poor travelers are approaching looking for help. The travelers are begging for x11 medicine. They need the medicine to help their friends at a nearby settlement that was devastated by raiders.

You can give items to the travelers by selecting a colonist and right-clicking on &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ananeur&lt;/color&gt;.

The travelers will move on after &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;1 day&lt;/color&gt;.

These travelers are not part of any faction. If you wish, you can choose to kill, arrest, sell, or harvest them, without diplomatic consequences.</description>
					<root>Beggars</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<charity>True</charity>
					<parent>null</parent>
