  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x250
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x96
    - Granite blocks x96
    - Limestone blocks x96
    - Slate blocks x96
    - Marble blocks x96

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;13 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;37 days&lt;/color&gt;. If any piece of it is destroyed, the archotech's enforcement system will activate and a weather-control system will force the weather around &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Crimson Haven&lt;/color&gt; to be a foggy rain for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;13 days&lt;/color&gt;.

You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
