					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Guga Tradoba&lt;/color&gt;, Canopy Chief of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Cabarpela Union&lt;/color&gt;, wants you to stash a special prisoner for her. The prisoner, a 35-year-old archer named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Dean 'Disaster' Hydronic&lt;/color&gt;, knows embarrassing information about &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tradoba&lt;/color&gt;'s self-control, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tradoba&lt;/color&gt; doesn't want her to be freed. You only need to keep the prisoner for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;14 days&lt;/color&gt; until the scandal passes. 

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Disaster&lt;/color&gt; is sick with blood rot and will require daily treatment. The disease can be slowed with high-quality care and medicine, but generally cannot be cured outright. If the disease becomes severe &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Disaster&lt;/color&gt; will die, so ensure you have the necessary medical supplies.</description>
