					<description>Baroness &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Aurelia Metpos&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Empire of God&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to insult the mining skill of her rival.

The monument is 13 x 7 in size and will require these resources (total value $513):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x390
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x180
    - Granite blocks x180
    - Limestone blocks x180
    - Slate blocks x180
    - Marble blocks x180

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;12 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;28 days&lt;/color&gt;. If any piece of it is destroyed, the baroness's enforcement system will activate and a pack of (*Threat)15 manhunting labrador retrievers(/Threat) will arrive.

You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
