						<leaderTitleMale>Canopy Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Canopy Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>For an eternity, there was a world of purple dust, until &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Loubai&lt;/color&gt; created the planets and stars. The God of Blood &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Loubai&lt;/color&gt; gave to his chosen followers the gift of hunger, so that they might know true strength. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Loubai&lt;/color&gt;'s forests renew the air that his people breathe, and give the boughs under which they shelter, and is the larder in which they forage.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>For an eternity, there was a world of purple dust, until %%deity0_name%% created the planets and stars. The %%deity0_type%% %%deity0_name%% gave to %%deity0_possessive%% chosen followers the gift of hunger, so that they might know true strength. %%Deity0_name%%'s forests renew the air that %%deity0_possessive%% people breathe, and give the boughs under which they shelter, and is the larder in which they forage.</descriptionTemplate>
