						<name>Foremost Faith</name>
						<adjective>Alainic</adjective>
						<memberName>Alainist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Fist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Fist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Alain&lt;/color&gt; cloaked the universe in darkness and placed humanity within it so that she could share the darkness with us. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Alain&lt;/color&gt; created light so that humanity could know &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Alain&lt;/color&gt; through the shadows light creates. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Alain&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% cloaked the universe in darkness and placed humanity within it so that %%deity0_pronoun%% could share the darkness with us. %%Deity0_name%% created light so that humanity could know %%deity0_name%% through the shadows light creates. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>ReligionD</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkBlue</colorDef>
