						<leaderTitleFemale>Christ's Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ-Lord&lt;/color&gt; gave birth to humans in a grand accident, and looked upon them with curiosity. Humanity's suffering brought &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ-Lord&lt;/color&gt; to terrible grief. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ-Lord&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</description>
