						<description>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that you never really know yourself until you've screamed in the pits of hell. That's why we're proud to express the strength of our hearts using the heels of our boots."

  - &lt;i&gt;A Perfect Life&lt;/i&gt; by Kasumi Houston</description>
