						<name>Bunker of Spiritism</name>
						<adjective>spiritist</adjective>
						<memberName>Spiritist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Spirit Foredigger</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Spirit Foredigger</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. The good spirits live in the shadows around us, resting in the spots just too hard to see. Living with the darkness brings them closer to us. It is prophesied that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Dim Remnant&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. The good spirits live in the shadows around us, resting in the spots just too hard to see. Living with the darkness brings them closer to us. It is prophesied that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>PirateE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightBlue</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Animist</li>
							<li>Darkness</li>
							<li>Tunneler</li>
						</memes>
